After leaking the phone calls to Mexico , the country &apos;s largest city in the world , and the country &apos;s largest city in the world , the city of Mexico , was put under pressure for the border wall payment .
Transcripts of telephone calls between U.S. President Donald SEN and leaders of Mexico and Australia have been published by the Washington Post .
On 27 January , in a telephone call with Mexican President Enrique Pena Nieto , the Governor of the city , he called for the government to stop saying that he would not pay for a planned border wall .
