Coe praises &quot; honest &quot; Russian apology for doping scandal .
The world &apos;s athlete &apos;s chief , Sebastian Coe , praised on Thursday what he described as a apparent excuse from Russia to a doping scandal , but he repeated that it was not the moment for the country to be reincorporated into the sport .
