When a non @-@ approved insecticide is used in the food industry , consumers are rightly outraged .
The product has put producers , dealers and consumers in a situation that is not absolutely necessary .
Basically , it must be clear : the illegal use of the insecticides Fipronil in the holding of food @-@ supplying animals is not acceptable and must be terminated without delay .
This must be done with a consistent and high pressure at all levels .
I expect all the authorities to provide a quick and complete information .
How the soccer &apos;s financial rules affect the move to Paris of Neymars .
The rules , which aim to prevent the unhindered spending of the European Football Clubs , will not disturb the world record transfer from the Spanish city to the French Paris @-@ Saint @-@ Germain .
Some consequences will come for Paris Saint @-@ Germain from UEFA , as the leader organisation that oversees the European game has the power to ban teams from accessing the prestigious Champions League Tournament .
Financial Fair Play rules , which were created by UEFA in 2011 , mean that at some point , PSG has to prove that the transfer of Neymar was funded without any major losses .
Barcelona has paid 222 million euros ( $ 262 million ) to the Brazilian out of his contract , and Neymar will receive a salary that will amount to several ten million dollars a year .
Here are some of the financial aspects of the move to France of Neymar .
PSG can certainly make the money easier for Neymar to sign and bring him to a galaxy of other stars , given the financing of the team by the power @-@ rich ruler family of Qatar .
Clubs may spend a lot of money on the purchase of players , but must counteract them with legitimate sources of income , which allow them to break even in their soccer @-@ related business .
FFP was designed by Michel Platini after being elected to the post of UEFA President in 2007 .
The former French player believed that clubs that had taken on enormous debts in their quest for success effectively cheat and risked destroying themselves when banks or owners withdrew their support .
In 2011 , FFP shifted from focusing on the club &apos;s debt to monitoring its losses .
The change meant that the business model that Roman Abramovich originally used in Chelsea in 2003 - bought a club with potential and then invested heavily to improve the team and build a global brand - should become a harder matter .
During the current three @-@ year FFP investment period , which runs until 2018 , clubs can accept losses of 30 million euros .
And even though Platini fell out of favor by the Presidency in 2015 , his UEFA successor , Aleksander Ceferin , is still committed to discourage excessive spending .
&quot; Certainly FFP is not dead and we will definitely be strengthening the rules for the future , &quot; said Andrea Traverso , who is responsible for FFP at the UEFA , to The Associated Press last week .
Although the PSG has paid the Neymar buy @-@ out clause in a flat rate , it may distribute the amount for the statement of account over the duration of its contract .
Neymar signed a five @-@ year contract , which allows the transfer fees for the next five years to be shown in the annual accounts of 44.4 million euros .
The first wave of FFP sanctions in 2014 hit the PSG with the most severe sanctions in the hands of Abu Dhabi , which is in the hands of Manchester City .
The PSG received a fine of 60 million euros ( at that time 82 million dollars ) , which was then reduced to 20 million euros - and it was arranged that the team members for the 2014 / 15 season championship league remain limited to 21 players instead of the other normal 25 players .
UEFA is looking for clubs that could try to outsource their financial supervision by increasing their revenues by companies affiliated to the owners of a club .
While a Catalan company could sponsor the PSG if the value of the sponsorship were to exceed the standard market rates , UEFA would not consider this as a legitimate income .
That was exactly what happened in 2014 , when UEFA decided that the value of PSA sponsorship was increased by the Qatar Tourism Authority .
It was reported that part of the PSG payments to Neymar could be made by the World Cup organizing committee in 2022 in Qatar .
But PSG and Qatar in 2022 denied that Neymar will become World Champion ambassadors and that such a manoeuvre could be easily determined for the UEFA regulators .
The sanctions against PSG to date mean that UEFA will be even more attentive to any attempt to circumvent the rules .
UEFA had no preparatory talks with PSG about the transfer of the NYMA , the people who are familiar with the situation said on Thursday .
They spoke to The Associated Press on condition of anonymity , as they were not authorized to discuss the PSG situation .
The latest reports show that PSG achieved a profit of more than 10 million euros in 2015 / 16 with a turnover of 542.4 million euros .
The accounts for the last financial year have to be published .
PSG expects that Neymar &apos;s arrival will be a blessing for sponsoring deals , merchandising and tricott sales .
The Association expects sales to increase by at least 30 percent after the signing .
