&quot; Comrade Detective &quot; on Amazon reminds us of a different kind of nostalgia : the revival of the Cold War by &quot; The Americans , &quot; the movie &quot; Atomic Blonde &quot; and even &quot; GLOW &quot; with its East @-@ West ringfight iconography .
The comedy created by Brian Gatewood and Alessandro Tanaka with Rhys Thomas as the director states to be a found TV series : a Romanian drama of the 1980s with the two policemen as friends , two Bucharest officers who are fighting for truth , atheism and the way of Marxism @-@ Leninism .
