How complains about large gaps in the Foreign Register
&quot; Data from citizens who should not appear &quot; : A report has shown that the foreign registry in Germany has a considerable deficiency .
This leads to sometimes serious misdecisions in the area of asylum procedures .
Frank @-@ Jürgen Weise , the Federal Government Commissioner for Refugee Management , has pointed out , in a media report , that there are large gaps in the central register of foreigners .
