For many , the idea is in need of getting used to .
Ingo Frobös has also dealt with the question for a long time .
For the professor at the German Sport Academy in Cologne , e @-@ Sport is a sport because it is competitive and shows many biological and physical reactions that can be found in classic sport - for example , increased heart rate , stress reaction , hormonal changes .
It also needs cognitive skills , a technical and tactical understanding and a quick reaction .
