Mordillos bullblazing and laughing at the suffering .
Mordillo was at times one of the most published cartoon designers , and the cracks of his figures are his trademark .
The Argentine is still working on a film at the age of 85 .
His message : laugh , &quot; for there is too much suffering in the world . &quot;
Guillermo Mordillo was born on August 4 , 1932 in Buenos Aires as the son of Spanish immigrants .
In the first years as an artist , he was among others a drawing artist for greeting cards - which frustrated him .
&quot; The happiest day in my professional life was the day when my job was lost , &quot; he once said .
