Even in China , Mordillo found many fans .
The artist was always inspired by cities .
Large , round figures of the Mordillo range in drawings with the leaning tower of Pisa , Big Ben in London and the Red Square in Moscow .
In the early morning , according to his own data , he is still at the drawing table today , working almost ten hours a day .
His drolful figures continue to be widespread throughout the world , including calendars , puzzles , books for adults and children , t @-@ shirts , cuddly toys and watches .
He has been working on a cartoon film for six years and a TV series with his characters .
The main person in the film &quot; Crazy Island &quot; is a giraffle - the most popular animal in his drawings - which has a thousand butcher as a counterpart .
For the first time , his characters speak in the 3D film , which will be released on the cinema screen in 2019 .
