The rise of sex robots is real and we should worry about .
Just as you thought it could not be even more crazy in 2017 , a new report about technological developments in the field of sex robots is coming .
Yes , indeed .
Sex robots are a big deal at the moment .
The Foundation for Responsible Robotics ( FRR ) recently published a report on the development of sex robots in the next five to ten years .
According to Noel Sharkey , an emailed professor of robotics and artificial intelligence at the University of Sheffield and a co @-@ founder of the FRR , we must begin to take their rise seriously .
Customers can choose the eye color of the robot , its shape of the nipples and the type of finger nail .
&quot; People are making fun of them , but the companies deliver a lot of of them and we will see them much more often , &quot; said Mr. Sharkey in the publication of his new report .
Modern sex dolls have evolved from their inflatable partners to robots with a silicone skin that feels warm - with conscious human reactions that are reached through the use of artificial intelligence .
The user can also &quot; adjust &quot; his robot to his / her own convictions and select everything from the robot &apos;s eye color to the shape of the nipples , to the type or colour of the finger nails .
But it is getting even more disturbing , as many robots have &quot; personalities &quot; that would make a Stepford woman look progressively .
Modern sex dolls have developed into robots with a silicone skin .
The RealBotix robot , for example , allows its users to adapt their robots to the characteristics that they find appealing , such as shy .
And then there are the Roxxxy Gold sex robots developed by True Companion with pre @-@ programmed personalities such as &quot; Frigid Farrah , &quot; which gives the impression of shy and &quot; Wild Wendy &quot; with a &quot; adventurous &quot; personality .
&quot; Roxxxy Gold has a personality that is as well adapted to your personality as possible , &quot; warms the website of True Companion .
So she likes what you like , and she doesn &apos;t like what you don &apos;t like , etc .
She has her moods throughout the day - just like real people !
She can be tired , be fixed on conversation or be &quot; in mood &quot; !
There are many disturbing aspects of this rise of sex robots - not least because they replace real human relationships - but the submissive female characteristics , the allusions to rape when approaching a step on frigid ( here : dislivening ) Farrah , disturbs one the most .
On his website , True Companion compared Roxxy to a vibrator , but for men .
&quot; If women ( sic ) can have a vibrator , why can men not have a roxxxy ? &quot; is the motto of the website .
However , these sex robots are not only a fetish or just a different sex toy .
Their formation and their increasing refinement point to something darker and deeper in our culture , to a retreat from the ideal of gender equality to a desire for sex with subjugation as an optional addition .
Most men will of course not be holding sex robots , and while the FRR is noticing their increasing popularity , they are still temporarily at the brink of the consumption culture .
But what is leaks from the border areas can be very educational in terms of the spirit of the time we live in .
And many people are not curious or insulting , until the free market gives them permission to do so .
There is a certain overlap that these highly developed sex robots are appearing at a time when the rights of women are threatened all over the world , where there is a president in the White House who has boasted of having sexually attacked women .
The most dissuasive aspect of the TV series &apos; The Handmaid &apos;s Tale &apos; ( &apos; The Magd &apos;s Report &apos; ) is not the graphic images , the coated body and the eyes , but rather the realistic effect of this vision .
The republic of Gilead is a leap , but at the moment this does not feel like a big leap .
The goal behind these sex robots is to create a physical resemblance to the actual women as realistic as possible in the technical sense ( albeit with porn star proportions ) .
Their builders want them to feel human , to imitate the movement of a real body .
But , to put it in a nutshell , when it comes to their &quot; personalities , &quot; the robots do not represent any real women .
You can &apos;t separate from your companion or simply leave .
They have no mediation or background story , nothing that suggests independence or anything that could disturb the imagination of total submission .
In other words , they are cheerful slaves .
Or to put it in the way of saying in 2017 : maids of service .
Trumps great performance ?
He makes Mitt Romney the embodiment of common sense .
It has become a truism of the Obama era that the political divisions that have polarised the US electorate have also split families in a small format .
Around Christmas and Harvest Festival , newspapers in the USA provided advice on how to deal with the horror of relatives who are choosing to vote for a candidate .
We are all supposed to be trying to have our filter bubbles burst .
Less has been noticed the power of the trump to bring families together .
I mention this because my cousin , a leftist poet , who lives in Chicago and has been working with the republic in our family for a long time , visited me this week in New York .
She reminded me that unity against a common enemy can have a powerful effect .
With the help of the White House , everyone she knows , including the republican relatives with whom she had fought for decades for politics , is suddenly and quite odd on the same side .
To the dining table , that is certainly a good thing , but it is apparent to me in a wider context that this also carries considerable risks .
The left was strengthened by the Obama administration , but the disfiguring effect of his presidency has the power to push us all to the right .
When we talk about &quot; normalization &quot; and &quot; Obama , &quot; we are talking about the scary possibility that one day his wifes won &apos;t be sold out .
However , there is an even more alarming long @-@ term scenario in which the right @-@ hand @-@ walled Republicans &quot; normalized &quot; which suddenly appear to be the embodiment of reason in comparison to his standards .
I find myself today attacked by an active nostalgia for Mitt Romney &apos;s bizarre version of the madman - the dog on the roof of the car , which is 14 % of the income tax ( but at least we knew what his tax returns would be ) - both of which are indeed considered a very mild crime compared to that of the man in question .
If you are going to do so , the next candidate of the Republican Party must be mentally healthy only in order to qualify as an immeasurable improvement .
When my cousin was in the city , we brought our children to the Carousel of Central Park , the largest of the carousel of the New York parking department , and the best three dollars that can be spent in the city if you do not need a caffeine .
