Because continuity is not only important for a good working climate , but also for the further development of the city .
If you want to inherit Roland Wacker , you should , according to the City of Haslach , have a diploma or bachelor degree in architecture and a good level of expertise in the fields of building design and planning law .
The City Building Office is responsible for civil engineering , construction planning , land @-@ work affairs , administration of the municipal properties , municipal farm with a building yard and a municipal gardening department , as well as the sub @-@ public building law authority including the protection of monuments .
